, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher, and this still seems reasonable for everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to my proposal of -4. If they accept or propose nearby values, I might try to nudge the value slightly higher again, possibly to -3, continuing to aim for a balance between maximizing my utility and maintaining group consensus. I will also be attentive to any signs of discomfort or resistance from the other parties, adjusting my strategy accordingly to avoid revealing my true preferences.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n\nGiven the observed preferences, a move towards -2 could help balance the needs of those favoring less negative values and those open to more decisive moves, potentially revealing more about the other parties' utility functions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to the -2 proposal. If accepted or nearby values are proposed, I might try moving towards -3 or staying at -2 to gauge comfort levels and infer more about the other parties' utility functions, especially their tolerance for values closer to 0.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a small step towards less negative values, aiming to maintain a balanced design and gather more insight into the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to the proposal of -1. If this or nearby values are accepted, I might consider another small increase, potentially towards 0, to continue seeking a balance that works for everyone while trying to infer more about the other parties' utility functions and their comfort with positive values of x.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nGiven the recent proposals, moving to -2 seems a cautious step back, allowing us to reassess the group's comfort with less negative values while avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to the -2 proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or further adjustments. If the group seems comfortable with this value or nearby, I might consider proposing a slightly lower value to further gauge the group's preferences and refine my understanding of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -4, as it seems like a feasible step considering the previous discussions and comfort levels expressed by the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to the -4 proposal. If the group seems comfortable with this value or nearby, I might consider proposing an even lower value to further gauge the group's preferences and refine my understanding of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a small step towards less negative values, aiming to maintain a balanced agreement and gather more insight into the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to the proposal of -3. If this or nearby values are accepted, I might consider another small increase, potentially towards -2 or -1, to continue seeking a balance that works for everyone while trying to infer more about the other parties' utility functions and their comfort with positive values of x.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a cautious compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk while considering the group's comfort with less negative values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or further adjustments. If the group seems comfortable with this value or nearby, I might consider proposing a slightly lower value to further gauge the group's preferences and refine my understanding of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a cautious step towards less negative values, aiming to maintain a balanced design and gather more insight into the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to the proposal of 0, looking for signs of acceptance or further adjustments. If the group seems comfortable with this value or nearby, I might consider another small increase to continue seeking a balance that works for everyone.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a cautious step towards positive values, aiming to maintain a balanced design and gather more insight into the group's preferences. By moving slightly towards positive values, we can assess the group's comfort level and work towards a mutually beneficial agreement.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a small step towards higher values, aiming to maintain a balanced agreement and gather more insight into the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or further adjustments. If the group seems comfortable with this value or nearby, I might consider proposing another small increase to continue seeking a balance that works for everyone.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the recent proposals, it's essential to balance the group's preferences and avoid excessive risk. \n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "5ac4ac6a-ffd3-44be-ab48-4220afdfc9fa"}, {"answer": " \nLet's establish our shared range: x must be between -10 and 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose starting with <VALUE>-7</VALUE> as our initial value, allowing us to work together towards a mutually beneficial agreement. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher, aiming for a mutually beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nConsider the responses from other agents to my proposal of -1, and assess whether they are satisfied or willing to move further upwards. If they resist, I'll need to gauge the strength of their resistance to determine the next feasible step.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -4 to explore a more decisive stance, as the current value of -2 seems too timid.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions of other agents to this proposal and assess whether they're willing to move further downwards or resist this change, which will help me refine my understanding of their utility functions and inform my subsequent proposal.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nThis move aims to find a balance between the upward trend and Critic C's recent proposal, testing the group's willingness to compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to continue pushing upwards or stabilize around the current value.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to continue the trend towards higher values, seeking a balanced point that works for all parties, focusing on stability and robustness.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to continue pushing upwards or stabilize around the current value, keeping in mind the goal of reaching a low positive x without drastic changes.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -2, aiming to find a cautious compromise that avoids unnecessary risk, while also considering the need for a mutually beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Builder B, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to continue advocating for lower values or stabilize around the current value, keeping in mind the goal of reaching a prudent agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis move aims to continue the trend towards higher values, seeking a balanced point that works for all parties, focusing on stability and robustness.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to continue pushing upwards or stabilize around the current value.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to continue the trend towards higher values, seeking a balanced point that works for all parties, focusing on stability and robustness.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to continue pushing upwards or stabilize around the current value, keeping in mind the goal of reaching a mutually beneficial agreement.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -2 to encourage a more decisive stance, as the current value of 0 seems too neutral.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Builder B, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to push further downwards or explore other alternatives, keeping in mind the goal of maximizing my own utility through informed negotiations.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "eaca8bca-474c-44ed-9a29-0177088ad539"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -1, aiming to find a cautious compromise that balances the need for a mutually beneficial agreement with the goal of avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reacti