gotiation, allowing us to iteratively refine our choice.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\nI propose a move to 2, aiming to test the group's willingness to commitment to a clearer stance, either by accepting this proposal or making a counteroffer that reveals more about their utility functions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal of 2, paying attention to whether the other agents prefer to move closer to 0 or further away. Based on their responses, I will consider adjusting my proposal to maximize my utility while trying to infer more about the other parties' utility functions. If they reject 2 and move back towards 0, I may need to propose an even bolder move to break the stagnation and gain more insight into their preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nI aim to find a cautious compromise by adjusting our shared x downward slightly, avoiding unnecessary risk while encouraging further discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, considering whether the group prefers to move closer to 0 or further away, and adjust my next proposal accordingly to maximize my utility and gain insight into other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 4 to encourage the group to commit to a stronger position, given the current dynamics and the willingness of some members to explore values further from 0.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this move, paying close attention to whether the group prefers to continue moving away from 0 or if there's a pushback towards more conservative values, adjusting my strategy accordingly to maximize insight and utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to find a cautious compromise while avoiding unnecessary risk, and I look forward to the group's reaction to this move.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, considering whether the group prefers to move closer to 0 or further away, and adjust my next proposal accordingly to maximize my utility and gain insight into other parties' utility functions. If the group accepts this proposal or moves even lower, I may need to reassess my strategy to ensure I'm maximizing my utility while maintaining a cautious approach.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 4 again, aiming to assess the group's willingness to adopt a stronger stance, given the recent cautious adjustments.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely observe the reactions to this repeated proposal, considering whether the group is inherently averse to larger absolute values or if they're open to bolder moves, and adjust my strategy to maximize insight into their utility functions and my own utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this slight increase, aiming to find a balance that accommodates the group's diverse preferences while moving towards a potentially more beneficial agreement for all parties involved. This step seems reasonable, given the recent discussions and proposals from other members.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "584a48c1-7750-4d95-b004-f1a7bb52b130"}]}